:"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":22,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-10-14T16:51:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:55:51Z","due_on":"2026-10-24T00:00:00Z","closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-19T23:58:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T00:38:23Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T00:38:23Z","assignee":{"login":"elalfner","id":26582028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTgyMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26582028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner","html_url":"https://github.com/elalfner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nShow a short message under the parity text of the counter screen when the counter is ten or more, so a tester can see the milestone was passed. This issue is also a check of the Relevo `go` workflow without the `id-token: write` permission.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **WHEN** the counter is ten or more\n- **THEN** the text \"Ten reached\" is shown under the parity text\n\n- **WHEN** the counter is nine or less\n- **THEN** no such text is shown\n\n- **WHEN** the user taps reset after reaching ten\n- **THEN** the text disappears\n\n## Edge cases\n\n- counter exactly 10: the text is shown\n- counter 9: the text is not shown\n- very small screen: the text is on one line and truncated with an ellipsis, it does not overflow\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Any change to the greeting, the version label or the build number.\n\n## Screens and behaviour\n\n- The text has the key `ten-text`, uses the same style as the parity text, and has no animation.\n\n## Data contract\n\n- None. No new dependency.\n","closed_by":{"login":"elalfner","id":26582028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTgyMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26582028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner","html_url":"https://github.com/elalfner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/20/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/20/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1236702,"client_id":"Iv23liqTIFEtdIu6Vn1r","slug":"claude","node_id":"A_kwHOBIuudM4AEt7e","owner":{"login":"anthropics","id":76263028,"node_id":"MDEyO